WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Welcome to the smart audio filtering test.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.000
In this sentence, I will say the word banana.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Now the audio should be completely back to normal.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Let us try another blocked word like apple.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Thank you for watching this prototype demonstration!